--- text
Second notice: your payment failed

The payment for your [PRODUCT_NAME] subscription has still not gone
through. This is the second notice. Your service is running as
normal for now.

Most failed payments are a card that has expired or been replaced.
Updating the card on file fixes it, and we try the payment again on
[RETRY_DATE].

Details of the payment

Amount: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT]
Plan: [PLAN_NAME]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]
Next attempt: [RETRY_DATE]

Important: If the payment has not gone through by [GRACE_END_DATE],
the subscription is paused on that date. [PRODUCT_NAME] then
becomes read-only: you can still sign in, read and export your
data, and nothing is deleted.

Update payment method:

[CTA_URL]

If you have already updated the card, no further action is needed.
The attempt on [RETRY_DATE] will use the new card.

If the amount or the card above is wrong, reply to this email, or
write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
